stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> preparing: participant claims the invitation
  state "Preparing" as preparing
  preparing : Sandbox from pinned template
  preparing : Base revision checked out
  preparing : Client recipe's dependencies
  preparing : Type check warmed in the checkout
  state "Prepared" as prepared
  prepared : No lease, data, or authority
  prepared : The base, or a version's files
  prepared : Baseline recorded, or still running
  state "Drafting" as drafting
  drafting : The request, then the proposal
  drafting : Egress opened to the model
  drafting : Still no lease or authority
  state "Claimed" as claimed
  claimed : Bound to the attempt
  claimed : and its fencing token
  claimed : Limit extended to the budget
  state "Released" as released
  released : Sandbox destroyed

  preparing --> prepared: checkout installed
  prepared --> drafting: the request or a proposal is drafted
  drafting --> drafting: a proposal adjusts it or starts over
  prepared --> claimed: approved attempt, matching pins, baseline recorded
  drafting --> claimed: approved attempt, matching pins, baseline recorded
  prepared --> released: case ends or one-hour window passes
  drafting --> released: case ends or one-hour window passes
  claimed --> prepared: its version passes its full checks · the next generation
  claimed --> released: the attempt ends without handing it over
  released --> [*]

  class preparing,prepared,drafting async
  class claimed runtime
  class released neutral
